# Keeps the build cache useful and the image reproducible.
#
# The build stage does COPY . ., so without this a markdown edit invalidates the
# layer and rebuilds all five binaries — defeating the GitHub Actions cache the
# workflow pays for. node_modules matters more: the web stage runs npm ci and
# then copies frontend-v2/, so a developer's local install would overwrite the
# clean one and the local smoke test would build a different bundle than CI.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.worktrees
.claude
.playwright-mcp
**/node_modules
**/dist
out
tmp-build
docs
*.md
!frontend-v2/README.md
scripts/devserve
